---
---

<section class="diff section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="diff__intro reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="diff__heading">Six things every other platform gets wrong</h2>
      <p class="diff__lead">Each one is a specific failure we found across twenty-four competitor platforms and nine Reddit threads of label owners describing what actually broke.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="diff__row reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="diff__text">
        <h3>Distributor-agnostic royalty hub</h3>
        <p>
          Ingest statements from DistroKid, TuneCore, CD Baby, FUGA, Symphonic,
          ONErpm, RouteNote, TooLost, Vydia, and The Orchard — auto-detected,
          normalized, and reconciled into a single royalty run. You keep every
          distributor relationship you already have.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 140" class="diff__svg">
          <g font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">
            <rect x="6" y="10" width="58" height="22" rx="5" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
            <text x="35" y="24" text-anchor="middle">.csv</text>
            <rect x="6" y="59" width="58" height="22" rx="5" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
            <text x="35" y="73" text-anchor="middle">.xlsx</text>
            <rect x="6" y="108" width="58" height="22" rx="5" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
            <text x="35" y="122" text-anchor="middle">DDEX</text>
          </g>
          <g stroke="var(--color-border)" fill="none">
            <path d="M64 21 L150 70" />
            <path d="M64 70 L150 70" />
            <path d="M64 119 L150 70" />
          </g>
          <circle cx="178" cy="70" r="30" fill="var(--color-accent-fill)" />
          <path d="M166 70l8 8 16-16" stroke="var(--color-on-fill)" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <text x="178" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">reconciled</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="diff__row diff__row--reverse reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="diff__text">
        <h3>Open source, no earnings tax</h3>
        <p>
          Self-host Good Faith on your own infrastructure. Never a percentage of
          royalties. Full CSV/JSON export whenever you want — your catalog is
          never locked behind a subscription.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 140" class="diff__svg">
          <g stroke="var(--color-border)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 4">
            <line x1="10" y1="30" x2="250" y2="30" />
            <line x1="10" y1="70" x2="250" y2="70" />
            <line x1="10" y1="110" x2="250" y2="110" />
          </g>
          <path d="M10 118 C 70 60, 130 20, 250 8" stroke="var(--color-border)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <line x1="10" y1="70" x2="250" y2="70" stroke="var(--color-primary-fill)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <text x="253" y="12" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="end" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">% of earnings</text>
          <text x="253" y="66" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-primary-text)" text-anchor="end" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">flat fee</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="diff__row reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="diff__text">
        <h3>Built for the indie-to-pro continuum</h3>
        <p>
          DIY tools like DistroKid stop working once you have real contracts
          and split sheets. Enterprise platforms like Synchtank aren't
          self-serve. Good Faith is built for the label in between — 5 to 100
          artists, growing complexity, no sales call required.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 100" class="diff__svg">
          <line x1="14" y1="60" x2="246" y2="60" stroke="var(--color-border)" stroke-width="2" />
          <circle cx="14" cy="60" r="4" fill="var(--color-border)" />
          <circle cx="246" cy="60" r="4" fill="var(--color-border)" />
          <text x="14" y="84" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="start" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">DIY tools</text>
          <text x="246" y="84" font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" text-anchor="end" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">Enterprise</text>
          <circle cx="130" cy="60" r="9" fill="var(--color-primary-fill)" stroke="var(--color-bg)" stroke-width="3" />
          <text x="130" y="34" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-primary-text)" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">Good Faith</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="diff__row diff__row--reverse reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="diff__text">
        <h3>Publishing admin without the 15&ndash;30% tax</h3>
        <p>
          PRO registration with ASCAP, BMI, SESAC, and SOCAN, CWR filing, and
          mechanical licensing — at the same flat fee, not a cut of your
          publishing income the way Songtrust takes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 120" class="diff__svg">
          <g fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-border)">
            <rect x="60" y="14" width="90" height="60" rx="6" />
            <rect x="75" y="26" width="90" height="60" rx="6" />
            <rect x="90" y="38" width="90" height="60" rx="6" />
          </g>
          <g stroke="var(--color-muted)" stroke-width="1.25">
            <line x1="102" y1="52" x2="158" y2="52" />
            <line x1="102" y1="64" x2="150" y2="64" />
            <line x1="102" y1="76" x2="158" y2="76" />
          </g>
          <circle cx="196" cy="70" r="18" fill="var(--color-accent-fill)" />
          <path d="M188 70l6 6 12-13" stroke="var(--color-on-fill)" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="diff__row reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="diff__text">
        <h3>Role-based operations security</h3>
        <p>
          Artists see their releases and royalties. Managers see the release
          calendar and budgets. Finance sees statements and contracts. A&amp;R
          sees the signing pipeline, nothing financial. Not a shared Notion
          doc everyone can see everything in.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 120" class="diff__svg">
          {['Artist', 'Manager', 'Finance', 'A&R'].map((role, i) => (
            <g transform={`translate(${10 + i * 62}, 20)`}>
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="50" height="70" rx="8" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
              <circle cx="25" cy="22" r="9" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary-fill)" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d="M12 52c2-10 24-10 26 0" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-primary-fill)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <text x="25" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">{role}</text>
            </g>
          ))}
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="diff__row diff__row--reverse reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="diff__text">
        <h3>Portability &amp; longevity guarantees</h3>
        <p>
          Every record you enter can leave in the same shape it came in.
          Open standards (DDEX, CSV, JSON), no proprietary lock-in — so a
          platform shutdown, acquisition, or price hike never strands your
          catalog the way closed tools can.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 110" class="diff__svg">
          <rect x="20" y="20" width="70" height="70" rx="8" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
          <path d="M40 55h30M60 45l10 10-10 10" stroke="var(--color-primary-fill)" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <g font-size="9" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-muted)" font-family="Libre Franklin, sans-serif">
            <rect x="150" y="12" width="46" height="22" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
            <text x="173" y="26" text-anchor="middle">CSV</text>
            <rect x="150" y="44" width="46" height="22" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
            <text x="173" y="58" text-anchor="middle">JSON</text>
            <rect x="150" y="76" width="46" height="22" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-border)" />
            <text x="173" y="90" text-anchor="middle">DDEX</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .diff__intro {
    max-width: 42ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .diff__heading {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
  }

  .diff__lead {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
  }

  .diff__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .diff__row + .diff__row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .diff__row--reverse {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .diff__row--reverse .diff__text {
    order: 2;
  }

  .diff__text h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
  }

  .diff__text p {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .diff__visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .diff__svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 17rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 56.25rem) {
    .diff__row,
    .diff__row--reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .diff__row--reverse .diff__text {
      order: 0;
    }

    .diff__visual {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
